# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Copy this file to .env and replace with your own key (never commit .env).
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# How to get a free Maps Demo Key (no billing or Cloud project required for prototyping):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a Google account (personal accounts work; no billing card required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate/reveal your Maps Demo Key and paste it above.
# Note: Maps Demo Key has daily quota limits and is for prototyping only.
#
# For production, create and restrict a Google Cloud API key at:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Address Validation API, Routes API, Maps Static API.
